/-
OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/KeepsModel.lean: every constant of the modules OnBytes.Iop.*, OnBytes.Model.*,
OnBytes.Proof.* under OnBytes.Model.VerifyStages (tests apart) whose type ends in a block or in a
routine over blocks, one line each, each after those that it calls. The order and the kind of each
line were found by the command keeps_find (OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/KeepsWalk.lean;
KeepsFind.lean [not in this library]); what counts is that this file compiles. The statement of each
line is keeps_stmt% of the constant: for all arguments, KeepsM of the constant at these arguments;
if an argument is itself a routine or a function into routines, under the hypothesis that it is
KeepsM.
  keeps_had       the fact stands already (KeepsKit, KeepsIop, KeepsEight, KeepsSub, KeepsLift):
                  checked
  keeps_walk      by unfolding the constant and the tactic keepsM
  keeps_walk_fn   the same for a routine that is written as a function of its state
  keeps_walk_rec  by the induction that follows the routine's own recursion, and keepsM
Three constants are not here: runLinkH, runLinksFrom, runLinksH run a link's routine, which is a
field of a record (OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/KeepsLinks.lean).
-/
